"The + at the left of the notch's top row starts a tab in a folder you pick: your login shell goes to the folder, then runs the command, so your PATH and the agent's own sign-in apply. Each tab is a widget on the dashboard that opens into its terminal, and it keeps running while the notch is closed. After Scout restarts the tabs come back by themselves, each in its folder, and the agents continue with the resume command; with that switched off they wait under + › Resume instead." = "Znak + lijevo u gornjem retku notcha pokreće karticu u mapi koju odaberete: vaš shell za prijavu ulazi u mapu pa pokreće naredbu, tako da vrijede vaš PATH i vlastita prijava agenta. Svaka kartica je widget na nadzornoj ploči koji se otvara u svoj terminal i nastavlja raditi dok je notch zatvoren. Nakon ponovnog pokretanja aplikacije Scout kartice se vraćaju same, svaka u svojoj mapi, a agenti nastavljaju naredbom za nastavak; kad je to isključeno, umjesto toga čekaju pod + › Nastavi.";
