"The open notch is one dashboard: the Agents widget and the Ask AI line are always there, and music, a meeting about to start, a timer, a download, a recording, AirPods and open to-dos show up by themselves while they are live. Click a widget and it grows into its full view; Esc goes back, a second Esc closes. Pinned widgets always show, next to the live ones: pin or unpin them here, arrange them by hand with Edit Nook (or right-click a widget)." = "Otvoreni notch je jedna nadzorna ploča: widget Agenti i redak Pitajte AI uvijek su tu, a glazba, sastanak koji uskoro počinje, mjerač vremena, preuzimanje, snimanje, AirPods i otvoreni zadaci pojavljuju se sami dok su aktivni. Kliknite widget i on se širi u puni prikaz; Esc vraća natrag, drugi Esc zatvara. Prikvačeni widgeti uvijek se prikazuju, uz aktivne: prikvačite ili otkvačite ih ovdje, ručno ih rasporedite pomoću Uredi Nook (ili desni klik na widget).";
